#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  Sovereign Ledger Engine
#  File: ledger.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Provides engineering reference for the immutable financial ledger used by
#    all ARKA income engines and Lux Trading AI.
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    • Immutable event store for all financial activity
#    • Balance tracking for internal accounts
#    • Used by:
#         - Astraa FinOps
#         - Distribution AI
#         - GEO Visibility AI
#         - Sovereign Finance Engine
#         - Lux Trading AI (profit allocation)
#         - ArkastraEngine
#         - Construction Estimator
#
#===============================================================================
#  DATABASE STRUCTURE:
#
#    Table: ledger_events
#      entry_id          TEXT PRIMARY KEY
#      source_engine     TEXT
#      event_type        TEXT
#      amount            REAL
#      currency          TEXT
#      metadata_json     TEXT
#      timestamp_epoch   REAL
#
#    Table: ledger_balances
#      account_key       TEXT PRIMARY KEY
#      balance           REAL
#      currency          TEXT
#      last_update       REAL
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    record_event(source, event_type, amount, currency, metadata)
#       → Writes immutable ledger entry.
#
#    update_balance(account, delta, currency)
#       → Adjusts account balance.
#
#    get_balance(account)
#       → Returns current balance.
#
#    query_events(source=None, event_type=None)
#       → Returns filtered ledger events.
#
#===============================================================================
#  IMPLEMENTATION LOCATION:
#
#    /home/keshanth/ARKA/ardhanarishvara/ArdhanarishvaraOS/kernel/ledger.py
